@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam defaultFontColor #172033
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam titleFontSize 20
skinparam ArrowFontSize 14
skinparam noteFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
title PAT lifecycle and authority checks
actor "Test user" as User
participant "PAT API" as API
database "Token metadata and protected credential storage" as DB
participant "Git authentication and repository policy" as Git
User -> API : Create disposable PAT while authenticated
API -> DB : Persist protected credential and owner
API --> User : Return raw token at creation only
User -> API : List owned token metadata
API --> User : Metadata without raw token
User -> Git : Present valid active PAT
Git -> DB : Resolve credential owner
Git --> User : Authorize by repository ownership and visibility
User -> API : Revoke owned PAT
API -> DB : Revoke credential
User -> Git : Retry revoked token
Git --> User : Reject authentication
note over Git : Invalid or malformed tokens also rejected
note over API : Separate read/write PAT scopes are deferred in V1.0.0
@enduml
